{"about_the_game":"When a galactic bulletin is posted on the Vulcan Bounty Hunter Network, a nearby group of Hunters led by the fugitive Patriot go to investigate.<br><br>Hecaton is futuristic action rogue-like set on Titan, a terraformed moon of Saturn.  Play as a Bounty Hunter and fight your way through an army of space pirates.  Brave the surface of Titan and begin your descent to find the Pirate Base and your ultimate goal.<br><br><strong> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Against an Army of Space Pirates</h2> </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263120/extras/91650b04cda423ba7d5d6272e9ff08cd.avif?t=1606340283\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br><strong> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as 8 Different Bounty Hunters</h2> </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263120/extras/2d3379db43c9a5d3c51e8f32d856326d.avif?t=1606340283\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br><strong> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Deep Progression System</h2> </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263120/extras/aa77ad5386f49ed00480114319421eda.avif?t=1606340283\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br><strong> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Powerful Equipment</h2> </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263120/extras/70b1be89231296a2b1a0466b3bb15f3a.avif?t=1606340283\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br><strong> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock 90 Unique Items</h2> </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263120/extras/fc6cdc6b444625a2be039f8ddd3e3271.avif?t=1606340283\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br>